      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "auto fact = [](auto &self, int n) -> long long {\n    if (n <= 1) return 1;\n    return n * self(self, n - 1);\n};\ncout << fact(fact, 5);    // 120",
